---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { site, fullAddress } from '../data/site';
---

<Legal title="Privacy Policy" description="How Elara Interiors collects, uses and protects the personal information you share with us." updated="3 November 2026">
  <p>
    This policy explains what personal information {site.name} (“we”, “us”) collects through this website, how we use it,
    and the choices you have. We follow the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023 and other applicable Indian law.
  </p>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Details you give us in the enquiry form: your name, phone number, email address, type of home, requirement and message.</li>
    <li>Information you share when you call, email or message us on WhatsApp.</li>
    <li>Basic technical data your browser sends, such as device type and pages visited, used to keep the site working well.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To reply to your enquiry and arrange a consultation.</li>
    <li>To prepare designs, quotations and carry out your project.</li>
    <li>To provide after-sales service.</li>
    <li>To meet legal, tax and accounting requirements.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not sell or rent your personal information.</p>

  <h2>Sharing</h2>
  <p>
    We share information only with service providers who help us run the business (for example email, hosting and
    messaging services), and only as much as they need to do that work, or when the law requires it.
  </p>

  <h2>Third-party services</h2>
  <p>
    The contact page can load a Google Maps view only after you choose to show it. WhatsApp links open WhatsApp, which is
    governed by its own privacy policy.
  </p>

  <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
  <p>
    We keep enquiry details for as long as needed to respond and, if you become a client, for the duration of your project
    and any period required by law.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    You can ask to see, correct or delete the personal information we hold about you, or withdraw consent for us to use it.
    Contact us using the details below and we’ll respond within a reasonable time.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    {site.name}<br />
    {fullAddress()}<br />
    Email: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a><br />
    Phone: <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phoneDisplay}</a>
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The date at the top shows when it last changed.</p>
</Legal>
